# The Ice Path (and the Dark Cave): HeartGold's SEQ_GS_D_KOORINONUKE, and this game a song of its own: a slow, cold
# celesta in D minor over glassy held strings, a bell that drips like meltwater and a deep bass. A cave plays the same
# by day and night. Original composition for this game (plan 20 · J10).
title The Ice Path
tempo 88
meter 4/4
reverb 0.5
night none

track lead celesta vol=0.86 pan=0 rev=0.5
  L o5 d4 f4 a2 | o5 g4 b-4 a2 | o5 f4 e4 d4 c+4 | o5 d2. r4 |
  o5 a4 o6 c4 d2 | o6 c4 o5 b-4 g2 | o5 a4 g4 f4 e4 | o5 a2. r4 |
  o5 f4 a4 o6 c2 | o5 b-4 o6 d4 c2 | o5 a4 f4 g4 e4 | o5 f2. r4 |
  o5 d4 f4 b-2 | o5 a4 g4 e2 | o5 f4 e4 c+4 e4 | o5 d2. r4 |

